sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant CLI as Shipmates CLI
    participant Server as Local loopback server
    participant Codex as codex app-server
    Operator->>CLI: shipmates open frontend
    CLI->>Server: authenticated controller attach
    Server->>Codex: start or resume live session
    Codex-->>Server: bounded normalized events
    Server-->>CLI: feed and snapshot
    opt exact approval request
        Codex-->>Server: bounded approval request
        Server-->>CLI: sanitized approval card
        Operator->>CLI: /allow-once or /deny
        CLI->>Server: controller-bound decision
        Server->>Codex: exact request response
    end
    Operator->>CLI: /detach
    CLI->>Server: release controller lease
